    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT OTHER GAMES</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872580/extras/e5c276e5c910c11411d24c6b678f4d99.avif?t=1727409442\" /></div>The kingdom is almost fully healed from a deadly war and humans have been experiencing a peaceful era. However, reports of spirits possession have been shocking some villagers and they have decided to ask for help in the Holy Temple.Now, Mia, a young princess who is becoming well-known for her diplomatic way to exorcise these creatures, is the one who will find the ones responsible for the problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872580/extras/7060093ab182a3b896fbf8c308bb7af8.webp?t=1727409442\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872580/extras/1c06dda947cdf39fe5c80f4eb51ea47d.webp?t=1727409442\" /></div>A Classic RPG Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872580/extras/1c06dda947cdf39fe5c80f4eb51ea47d.webp?t=1727409442\" /></div>Day and Night System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872580/extras/1c06dda947cdf39fe5c80f4eb51ea47d.webp?t=1727409442\" /></div>Turn-based Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872580/extras/1c06dda947cdf39fe5c80f4eb51ea47d.webp?t=1727409442\" /></div>Explore a Fantasy World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">